    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional 2-Bedroom Ground Floor Apartment – Dun na Coirbe, Headford Road, Galway\r\nKevin O'Flynn and Keller Williams Galway are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground-floor apartment located in the highly sought-after Dun na Coirbe development on the Headford Road.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 65 sq.m. (700 sq.ft.), this bright and spacious apartment was built in 2000 and boasts a BER rating of C, offering comfortable and energy-efficient living. Presented in excellent turn-key condition throughout, the property is ready for immediate occupation with nothing further required by its new owners.\r\n\r\nThe well-designed accommodation comprises an inviting entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, two generously sized bedrooms (including a master bedroom with en-suite), and a main bathroom. The ground-floor setting provides exceptional accessibility and convenience, making it an ideal choice for a wide range of buyers.\r\n\r\nWhether you are a first-time buyer seeking a stylish and well-located home, an investor looking for a property in a consistently strong rental market, or a downsizer searching for low-maintenance living, this apartment ticks all the boxes.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nSpacious 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom ground-floor apartment\r\nApprox. 65 sq.m. / 700 sq.ft.\r\nBuilt in 2000\r\nBER Rating: C\r\nPresented in excellent turn-key condition\r\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout\r\nMaster bedroom with en-suite bathroom\r\nGround-floor location offering easy access and convenience\r\nAmple resident and visitor parking available on site\r\nWell-maintained development with management company in place\r\nHighly sought-after residential development\r\nExcellent investment, owner-occupier, or downsizer opportunity\r\nPrime Location\r\nDun na Coirbe enjoys a superb location just off the Headford Road, one of Galway City's most convenient and well-connected residential areas. The property is within easy reach of:\r\n\r\nGalway City Centre\r\nUniversity of Galway\r\nUniversity Hospital Galway (UHG)\r\nTerryland Retail Park\r\nShops, supermarkets, cafés, and restaurants\r\nExcellent public transport links\r\nMajor road networks including the M6 and N84\r\nCombining a superb location, turnkey presentation, generous accommodation, and ample on-site parking, this outstanding apartment offers a fantastic opportunity to acquire a quality home or investment property in one of Galway's most popular residential developments.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment.\r\n\r\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, contact Kevin O'Flynn, Keller Williams Galway today."
      },
